      "id": 64437,
      "name": "Koey",
      "username": "Koey",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koey/{size}/2187_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-29T12:04:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"penta\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/6f9a4e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> penta:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I couldn't bring myself to cough up the 40 bucks to become a playtester. Now i'm wishing i did. Do the play test cards have artwork on at least a few?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>But you do get to see the name of cards. Which gives good flavor of how each deck functions.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I believe it was also through theme of La Captain's deck that PT's were able to guess where the Samurai from Omnitron's armor was when it was first released in a KS update. ( I believe it was Ronway that wrote it back then, just going by memory)</p>",
